  "limitations": [
    "Initial single clip per rig, no blending/graph/events/IK/root motion/retargeting or general C# animation service yet.",
    "Actual Mixamo content and direct FBX import remain unqualified; synthetic glTF fixtures establish only supported-profile behavior.",
    "Animated authoring creates all source model nodes, rendering only selected-scene primitives. Structural live editing requires runtime restart.",
    "Bone transforms own their descendants; physics and controller-driven cameras cannot share those transforms. No deforming skinned acoustic geometry.",
    "Cubic invalid pose or runtime matrix failure rolls back the whole step; later GPU-only failure does not rewind committed simulation.",
    "Test captures are simple analytic ribbons; no production crowd throughput, broad asset coverage or game performance claim.",
    "Native Linux graphics and consoles remain unqualified.",
    "Cinematics/post-processing research and GUI/package priorities are documentation; those frameworks are not implemented by this milestone."
  ],
